     "finalAnswer": "(0, 6) \\text{ and } \\left(\\frac{12}{2+\\pi}, 0\\right)",
     "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"250\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"110.0\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"254\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"254\"/><line x1=\"230.0\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"230.0\" y2=\"254\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"254\"/><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"254\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"212\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"212\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"174\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"136\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"98\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"98\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"60\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"22\"/></g><g fill=\"currentColor\"><text x=\"110.0\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.5</text><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"230.0\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><text x=\"290.0\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.5</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"12\">y</text><text x=\"388\" y=\"244\">x</text></g><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"330.1\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"22\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><circle cx=\"330.1\" cy=\"250\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><g fill=\"#2563eb\"><text x=\"78\" y=\"27\">(0, 6)</text><text x=\"330.1\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(2.33, 0)</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"110\">y = (12 − (2+π)x)/2</text></g></svg>"
