     "finalAnswer": "\\text{Net of six rectangles: two } 7 \\times 3,\\ \\text{two } 7 \\times 2,\\ \\text{two } 2 \\times 3",
     "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 392 350\"><path d=\"M20 10v330M42 10v330M64 10v330M86 10v88M86 120v220M108 10v330M130 10v330M152 10v330M174 10v330M196 10v330M218 10v330M240 10v330M262 10v330M284 10v88M284 120v220M306 10v330M328 10v330M350 10v330M372 10v330M20 10h352M20 32h352M20 54h352M20 76h352M20 98h352M20 120h352M20 142h352M20 164h352M20 186h352M20 208h352M20 230h352M20 252h352M20 274h352M20 296h352M20 318h352M20 340h352\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-opacity=\"0.15\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"32\" width=\"154\" height=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"76\" width=\"154\" height=\"66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"142\" width=\"154\" height=\"44\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"108\" y=\"186\" width=\"154\" height=\"66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"76\" width=\"44\" height=\"66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"262\" y=\"76\" width=\"44\" height=\"66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"47.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\">7 × 2</text><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"113.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\">7 × 3</text><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"157.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\">7 × 2</text><text x=\"185.0\" y=\"223.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\">7 × 3</text><text x=\"86\" y=\"113.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\">2 × 3</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"113.0\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2563eb\">2 × 3</text></svg>"
